    <detaileddescription>
<para><ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_cross_cluster_subscription" kindref="compound">CrossClusterSubscription</ref></para>
<para>Subscribes to a <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_cross_cluster_publication" kindref="compound">CrossClusterPublication</ref> and delivers received WAL entries to a local apply callback. Tracks applied/error counts and the last applied sequence number for monitoring.</para>
<para>Usage: <ref refid="classthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_cross_cluster_subscription" kindref="compound">CrossClusterSubscription</ref> sub(&quot;orders_sub&quot;, pub, [](const <ref refid="structthemisdb_1_1replication_1_1_w_a_l_entry" kindref="compound">WALEntry</ref>&amp; e){ local_store.apply(e); }); sub.enable(); </para>
    </detaileddescription>
